<reference id="_headinghprbkgom6b97a" xml:lang="en-us">
   <title>Scenario 14 — Paragraph Between Numbered List in a Procedure</title>
   <shortdesc>Consider a procedure where the author has inserted a &lt;p&gt; element between two numbered steps</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <keyword>backup</keyword>
        <keyword>steps</keyword>
        <keyword>Backup</keyword>
        <keyword>Paragraph</keyword>
        <keyword>procedure</keyword>
        <keyword>element</keyword>
        <indexterm>backup</indexterm>
        <indexterm>steps</indexterm>
        <indexterm>Backup</indexterm>
      </keywords>
      <prodinfo>
        <prodname></prodname>
      </prodinfo>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
   <refbody>  
     <section>
    <p>Consider a procedure where the author has inserted a <codeph>&lt;p&gt;</codeph> element between two numbered steps to add explanatory text before continuing the numbered list.</p>
        <table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
           <title>Paragraph between steps in procedure</title>
           <tgroup cols="2">
              <colspec colname="c1"/>
              <colspec colname="c2"/>
              <thead>
                 <row>
                    <entry>
                       <b>HTML Input</b>
                    </entry>
                    <entry>
                       <b>DITA Output</b>
                    </entry>
                 </row>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                 <row>
                    <entry>
                       <codeblock>
&lt;h2 id="configure-backup">Configure Backup&lt;/h2>
&lt;ol>
  &lt;li>
    Open Backup Settings.
    &lt;p>The backup location must have at least 10 GB of free space.&lt;/p>
  &lt;/li>
  &lt;li>Select the backup destination.&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol></codeblock>
                    </entry>
                    <entry>
                       <codeblock>
&lt;task id="configure_backup">
  &lt;title>Configure Backup&lt;/title>
  &lt;taskbody>
    &lt;steps>
      &lt;step>
        &lt;cmd>Open Backup Settings.&lt;/cmd>
        &lt;info>
          &lt;p>The backup location must have at least 10 GB of free space.&lt;/p>
        &lt;/info>
      &lt;/step>
      &lt;step>
        &lt;cmd>Select the backup destination.&lt;/cmd>
      &lt;/step>
    &lt;/steps>
  &lt;/taskbody>
&lt;/task></codeblock>
                    </entry>
                 </row>
              </tbody>
           </tgroup>
        </table>
        <p>
            <b>Result:</b> The <codeph>&lt;p&gt;</codeph> element between two numbered steps is nested inside the preceding step's <codeph>&lt;info&gt;</codeph> element and doesn't break the procedure into separate <codeph>&lt;steps&gt;</codeph> blocks.</p>
  </section>
   </refbody>
</reference>
